{"id":"vod_bf_8036","vodId":"8036","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"动物新世代","name_cn":"动物新世代","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/4ec71821b29b08273889e2520d275b04.jpg"},"summary":"21世纪，一直以来隐藏在历史暗处的兽人们的存在开始为人所知。曾是普通人类的影森满，某天突然变成了狸兽人。她为了逃避人类而前往的兽人特区“动物都市”，是十年前兽人为了像兽人一样活着而建造的兽人专属的城镇。满在那里与厌恶人类的狼兽人·大神士郎相遇，并和他一起行动。在此期间，她学习到自己在人类世界所不知道的“兽人们”的烦恼、生活以及喜悦。满为何会变成兽人呢？就在追寻谜底的过程中，她自身也被卷入了意想不到的巨大事件当中","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:24:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/dongwuxinshidai/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:56.664Z"}